{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18260360","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260360","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:1:1826033001:":{"text":"精妙的魔法，不愧是梅林阁下","source_cn":"精妙的魔法，不愧是梅林阁下","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x405F1D33E9BF3021","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"248878","variant_female_record_index":"248879","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1826034001:1":{"text":"如果一切准备就绪，我就让仆人们将斯莱泽请入庄园了。","source_cn":"如果一切准备就绪，我就让仆人们将斯莱泽请入庄园了。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x8ADC8516118B55D3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"248880","variant_female_record_index":"248881","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826034002:1":{"text":"你飞快地在脑海里梳理了一遍班题斯贵族可能询问的问题，猛然间想起了一件重要的事——炼化间的毁坏。","source_cn":"你飞快地在脑海里梳理了一遍班题斯贵族可能询问的问题，猛...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA21377DA2A28F8D3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"248882","variant_female_record_index":"248883","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826034003:1":{"text":"亡灵转化器被毁，骸骨之王肯定不会善罢甘休。这次派贵族前来，极有可能向苔佩希兴师问罪。","source_cn":"亡灵转化器被毁，骸骨之王肯定不会善罢甘休。这次派贵族前...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x82E96D5DE1E0F50E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826034004:1":{"text":"瑟恩、巴登等人都已离开诺珐斯，你需要给出一位新的“犯人”，才能暂时压住班题斯的疑心。","source_cn":"瑟恩、巴登等人都已离开诺珐斯，你需要给出一位新的“犯人...","sta