status":""},"say:25:1826036001:1":{"text":"苔佩希小姐，许久未见。您还是这样优雅。","source_cn":"苔佩希小姐，许久未见。您还是这样优雅。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x6CB752DA4C495CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1826036001":{"text":"苔佩希小姐，许久未见。您还是这样优雅。","source_cn":"苔佩希小姐，许久未见。您还是这样优雅。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x6CB752DA4C495CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1826036002:1":{"text":"斯莱泽先生，余和你没有私人交情。这个开场白未免太过俗套。","source_cn":"斯莱泽先生，余和你没有私人交情。这个开场白未免太过俗套。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x5BE2BC3CB712D4B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1826036003:1":{"text":"呵呵，身为吸血鬼的您，记忆力还是那么出众。","source_cn":"呵呵，身为吸血鬼的您，记忆力还是那么出众。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA28E7A339D473FBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1826036004:1":{"text":"此番前来诺珐斯，所为何事？打搅淑女的休息时间，可是一件非常不礼貌的事情。","source_cn":"此番前来诺珐斯，所为何事？打搅淑女的休息时间，可是一件...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x109F50BC00E80250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1826036005:1":{"text":"陛下听闻诺珐斯戒严，连日来动荡不安，所以特意派遣我前来视察——哦，不，不是视察，是慰问。","source_cn":"陛下听闻诺珐斯戒严，连日来动荡不安，所以特意派遣我前来...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x0D86252A7FD86029","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1826036006:1":{"text":"不过方才在城内时，我注意到戒严已经解除，只是某些街道上还有鱼龙混杂的人群，想来事情应该已经得到妥善解决了？","source_cn":"不过方才在城内时，我注意到戒严已经解除，只是某些街道上...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xAE98AEE765343C79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1826036006":{"text":"不过方才在城内时，我注意到戒严已经解除，只是某些街道上还有鱼龙混杂的人群，想来事情应该已经得到妥善解决了？","source_cn":"不过方才在城内时，我注意到戒严已经解除，只是某些街道上还有鱼龙混杂的人群，想来事情应该已经得到妥善解决了？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xAE98AEE765343C79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1826036007:1":{"text":"自然是早已恢复正常。难道陛下是在怀疑，余连这种小事都解决不了吗？","source_cn":"自然是早已恢复正常。难道陛下是在怀疑，余连这种小事都解...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x8B6341254457837D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1826036009:1":{"text":"そうか……","source_cn":"是吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63C05D3752325395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35: